comments.body:
@damdo I want to request perfscale team to rerun the 2000 machine scale-up after all 3 PR linked to this bug merge. I am confident this change is safe. I am proposing we merge this with e2e only. 

https://github.com/openshift/machine-api-operator/pull/1521 PR actually sets this to concurrency=10
https://github.com/openshift/cluster-machine-approver/pull/310 Core fix to avoid the issue even if concurrency=10 does not help.
